msgid ""
"The card could not be read.\n"
"This problem can probably be fixed by blowing on the card's contacts!"
msgstr ""
"Kartu nebolo možné prečítať.\n"
"Tento problém sa dá pravdepodobne vyriešiť fúknutím na kontakty karty!"

msgid ""
"A card has been detected but is not yet associated with a game. Use START "
"menu on a game to associate."
msgstr ""
"Bola zistená karta, ktorá zatiaľ nie je priradená k žiadnej hre. Na "
"priradenie použite na hre ponuku tlačidla START."

msgid "Arcade"
msgstr "Arkáda"

msgid ""
"The Recalbox team thanks you for your trust!\n"
"\n"
"Let's take advantage of this first launch to discover together how to use:\n"
"- your Recalbox"
msgstr ""
"Tím Recalbox vám ďakuje za vašu dôveru!\n"
"\n"
"Využime toto prvé spustenie na to, aby sme si spoločne ukázali, ako "
"používať:\n"
"- svoj Recalbox"

